WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Vox Jot is free, open-source dictation for Mac.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
Hold one shortcut and speak naturally.

00:09.000 --> 00:18.000
“This sentence was transcribed locally and placed exactly where my cursor was.”

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
No copy and paste. No account. Core transcription stays on this Mac.

00:24.000 --> 00:32.000
Dictation Modes can adapt tone and output for different apps.

00:32.000 --> 00:38.000
Optional models are installed only when you choose them.

00:38.000 --> 00:45.000
Download the signed build free. Inspect the source. Support development if it earns your support.
